splashshot boot-splash
# Home tabs and type-to-find.
shot home-chats
key right
shot home-contacts
key right
shot home-nodes
key right
shot home-channels
key right
type ali
shot home-find
key esc
key esc
shot home-esc-twice-stays
# A long message: the selected chat's preview scrolls to its very end.
rx dm 0 Meet at the trailhead at 9, then up the ridge road to the Hilltop repeater; bring water and a spare battery.
wait 200
shot home-chats-long
wait 25000
shot home-chats-long-end
